{"id":"int-fba414624d61740b849df94dac0d0ea5","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-21T14:21:00.286901993Z","actor":"Dustin","issue_id":"llmkit-3db","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Applied, pushed, and replayed end to end.\n\nMerged: 3c80e9c (governance files, direct push to master with 'Bypassed rule violations: Changes must be made through a pull request; 4 of 4 required status checks are expected') and PR #11 -> fa2a56c.\n\nPR #11 was the acceptance replay of the gate:\n- unsigned commit -> DCO check failed in 6s with the amend/rebase fix instructions in the log\n- amended with --signoff -> DCO passed in 4s\n- all four required checks SUCCESS, mergeStateStatus still BLOCKED / REVIEW_REQUIRED, so green CI alone cannot merge an external PR\n- gh pr merge --admin bypassed the review gate; head branch auto-deleted by delete_branch_on_merge\n- rule-suite audit log records fail -> bypass -> bypass for the probe, master, and branch-creation pushes\n\nAlso folded in: ci.yml push trigger scoped to branches [master]. Before the fix a same-repo PR reported each required context twice (push run + pull_request run), which is an ambiguous merge gate; after it, exactly four checks report once. README and docs/testing.md corrected to match. Master CI green on both commits."}}
